{"ID":"20240314091905-svtls7i","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091905-svtls7i","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091905-svtls7i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165754-gsb06m8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165754-65ft5sh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165754-65ft5sh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:146,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:146\u0026#125;","title":"【大半夏汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422165754"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422165754-gsb06m8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422165754-gsb06m8","updated":"20240422165754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃反呕者，大半夏汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165754-co1l24r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165754-co1l24r","updated":"20240422165754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大半夏汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165754-l68qp5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165754-l68qp5m","updated":"20240422165754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏二升人参三两白蜜一升"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165754-gbwflrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165754-gbwflrb","updated":"20240422165754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水一斗二升，和蜜扬之二百四十遍，煑药取二升半，温服一升，余分再服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165754-kynu891","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165754-kynu891","updated":"20240422165754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃反"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，是一个症状，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"朝食暮吐，暮食朝吐，我们叫胃反"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。胃反呕吐者，大半夏汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165754-mm22mr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165754-mm22mr5","updated":"20240422165754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大半夏汤跟小半夏汤："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小半夏汤是胃里面有停水、恶心、打嗝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那个，我们用半夏跟生姜对不对。大半夏汤呢，半夏、人参、跟白蜜，大家注意看这个处方后面怎么组这个药，就大概知道为什么这样处方了。他说还没有煮药之前，水跟蜂蜜和一和，混和在一起，意思是说让蜜溶解在水里面。那你可以用这个三碗水，比如说，半夏我们用五钱，人参三钱哦，白蜜一碗，你不一定要找白的蜜，蜂蜜就可以了。那我们比如说，你准备是用六碗水煮两碗，可是五碗水加上一碗蜂蜜，不就等于六碗嘛，你把它和在一起。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165754-uc1cfcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165754-uc1cfcv","updated":"20240422165754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和在一起后，再去煮这两味药，六碗水煮两碗。那你如果说要强一点。你说老师这个药都没什么嘛，我们如果说恶心的，吐成这样子哦，我们把三碗水煮成一碗，变成说两碗水混合一碗蜂蜜和在一起，是不是还是三碗？让它和在一起后，三碗水再去煮成一碗。好，那温服一升，吃下去以后......为什么这么做，为什么用这个处方？当我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"恶心得很厉害的时候，胃的津液会伤到，津液伤到的时候，我们经方里面都是用人参把这个津液补回去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。人参如果市场上太贵，那用党参也可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165754-yxjg48q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165754-yxjg48q","updated":"20240422165754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那半夏呢，最主要的是利水利尿哦。那这个人胃反呕吐很久了，肠胃津液也伤到。所以当你用这个半夏止呕，把水去掉以后呢，人参下去把这个肠胃的津液补足。还怕半夏太强，把水又利掉太多，那人参白用了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以为什么要用白蜜的水去煮它？因为蜂蜜跟它（人参）能够把这个好的津液呢，巩固在肠胃里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为白蜜是甜的，甘味本来就是补土，这里就是用蜂蜜的原因就在这里面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以大半夏汤的症状，会比小半夏汤症状来得严重一点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165754-vd9acu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165754-vd9acu3","updated":"20240422165754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以大家看到这个条辨以后，287 页这个条辨以后，我们知道蜂蜜可以把肠胃的津液补足，能够很好得固到肠胃。所以说，这个蜂蜜的确是美容养颜哦。大家太太小姐们，如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"要这个皮肤长得很好，喝点蜂蜜水哦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"但是你喝蜂蜜之前要注意哦，千万不要有伏热。大便不好的时候，你又把它固住，蜂蜜下去把它固住，结果本来目的是要皮肤美白的对不对，皮肤变得很好。结果跑了一大堆痘子出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165754-65ft5sh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165754-65ft5sh","updated":"20240422165754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你说老师呀，别人吃蜂蜜呢皮肤都很好，我吃蜂蜜长了很多痘子...你有伏热。然后要把大便先清出来，所以..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们要让皮肤变得很好，一个大原则，要让皮肤变得很好，身上有伏热、伏饮、痰饮通通要先把它去掉，去掉之后我们一养皮肤就会很好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你不相信我来帮你养，保证你皮肤超级美哦。这是一个治证的大原则。哦。"}]}]}